window.products.push({"id":1082261,"name":"Progressive International 1-1/2 Quart Collapsible Mesh Strainer, Red and White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31vKV7AG4ML._AC_.jpg","description":"Reclaim storage space in your kitchen with this innovatively designed collapsible wire mesh hand strainer in red from Progressive International--a great choice for cramped kitchens. It drains liquids quickly and with its fine mesh bottom it doubles as a flour sifter. The long, 7-inch handle keeps hands away from hot water and steam when straining. It has a 1-1/2-cup capacity. But more than just a convenient way to drain pasta and rinse fresh fruit and veggies, this ingenious strainer vertically collapses to 1/3 of its original size for storage--perfect for saving cupboard space as well as conserving space in your dishwasher. The expandable part of the strainer is constructed of durable food-grade silicone that will both hold its shape when used as a bowl as well as offer easy flexibility when collapsing down for storage. Dishwasher safe. Great for draining pasta as well as for rinsing fruits and veggies. The 7-inch long handle keeps hands away from hot water. Collapses to just 1/3 of its size for storage and dishwashing. About Progressive International Progressive International understands that more than a workspace, the contemporary kitchen is the heart of the home where we connect with family and friends. Its in-house designers spend hours in the kitchen coming up with ways to improve on a variety of traditional tasks and tools. Like all good inventors, it all start with imagination and then switches to the practical. Taking ideas from all kinds of places--including suggestions from customers about what they would like to have in their kitchens--the designers tinker, adjust, and think outside the box until they come up with newer and better ways to make cooking more fun, interesting, and efficient. Progressive International has been in the kitchenware business for over thirty years, and its products are sold in the United States, Canada, Europe, South America, and other international markets.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31vKV7AG4ML._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Progressive International","source_asin":"B001CTAJSG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1082261","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001CTAJSG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001CTAJSG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1082262,"name":"VEHHE Ice Cube Trays 6 PACK, Reusable Silicone 14-Ice Cube Trays with Spill-Resistant Removable Lid, Flexible and Odorless, for Whiskey and Cocktails","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Pyn4tSojS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Food grade safety material: This 6 pack ice cube trays, each with 14 ice cubes is made of food-safe silicone material, odorless, can be used for making adult and baby food, suitable for home, bar, party, etc. Effortless to release: Compared with the previous hard plastic ice trays, the bottom of this silicone ice cube tray is made of soft silicone material and has good flexibility. Take out the frozen ice cubes from refrigerator, just rinse it with cold water or leave it for a minute, and ice cubes will be easliy released by pushing the soft bottom. Stackable & removable lid: This silicone ice cube tray with a lid that prevents ice from absorbing other food air in the refrigerator. And this ice trays with covers can be easily and neatly stacked in the refrigerator to save space. Clean and tidy! Easy to use & dishwasher safe: Fill the trays with water, cover the lid on, then freeze it into ice cube. Easy to use. and after using, you can clean this reusable ice cube by hand, and you can also wash it in dishwasher. It is very convenient ! Perfect ice cube mold for DIY: This ice cube mold perfect for making ice cubes or filling the molds with drinks, fruit, yogurt, jelly, chocolate. you can use it to DIY cold food that you favorite.This ice cube trays with lids can provide you pleasant ice-making experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Pyn4tSojS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VEHHE","source_asin":"B0928NSWCN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1082262","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0928NSWCN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0928NSWCN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
