window.products.push({"id":1082265,"name":"Dandelion Travertine Drink Coasters - Set of 4 Absorbent Tile Summer Coasters","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812XYWnSl-L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Set of Dandelion - Wild Flower Travertine Drink Coasters Included: ♦ Set of four stone coasters ( 4 x 4 ) ♦ Cork backed ♦ Unsealed- completely natural ♦ Tied together with a beautiful piece of twine This set of plain travertine tile coasters are a beautiful product of nature. The tumbled travertine tile is a natural stone making each piece of stone individual in its design and colors. While the set will match each stone will look slightly different from the next due to the wonderful natural pattern of specks of color, streaks, grooves, small holes, chips, and rounded corners. Each travertine coaster is backed with a 3.5\" by 3.5\" piece of adhesive cork to protect any surface they are placed on. While adhesive cork is expensive, it allows for a smooth and permanent attachment. This is compared to using regular cork with hot glue that leaves the cork bumpy and makes the coaster uneven. These tile coasters are also completely natural. Which means that no sealant is applied. They are solely tile and cork which allows for maximum water absorption that sealed coasters simply does not provide. Each tile is roughly 4 inches by 4 inches and 3/8 inches tall (( with cork approx. 7/16\" tall )) The coaster pictured are just a representation of the set you will receive. Each set is made to order which makes your set a one of a kind custom set. To clean: ♦ Use a damp cloth, when the coaster gets wet it will turn a tan color, it will dry by to normal color, however they may stain if a liquid other than water sits on them. Do not put in the dishwasher or leave sitting in water since the cork might get ruined. The coasters pictured above are not necessarily the ones you will receive since multiple sets are offered, however they will all look similar, each stamped image may have different white spots or none at all due to where the most pressure is put when I stamp","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812XYWnSl-L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Acorn Hill Collective","source_asin":"B079677PTL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1082265","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079677PTL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079677PTL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1082266,"name":"Dayette HEPA Air Purifiers for Home Large Room, CADR 400+ m³/h Up to 1720 Sq Ft, H13 Ture Hepa Air Filter Cleaner for Allergies Pet Dander Smoke Dust ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":179.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pErIPHiyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CADR: 400+ m³/h Up to 1720 sq ft: Featured with Turbo-air Technology and 360° air inlet, Providing you with a new and comfortable air throughout the day in your home or office. H13 True HEPA Filtration: This HEPA air purifier equipped with a 4-Stage Filtration system, works alongside the Pre-Filter and High-Efficiency Activated Carbon Filter to capture 99.97% of airborne particles 0.3 microns in size. Feel The Air Change: This air cleaner with built-in PM2.5 sensitive infrared air quality sensor, a color-coded light from blue/very good to green/good to yellow/moderate to red/polluted and by automatically adjusting the fan speed in response to changes in the current air quality. Comes with an air quality indicator so you can detect air quality. Filter Replacement Made Easy: Variety of replacement filters to meet your needs(Toxin Absorber Filter, Smoke Remover Filter, Pet Allergy Filter). We recommend replacing the air filter every 4-6 months to ensure optimal air purification. The AP401 practically serves your home while blending in with your decor. FCC certified, ETL Listed, CARB approved and 100% OZONE FREE.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pErIPHiyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DAYETTE","source_asin":"B0C8N3M6T3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1082266","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C8N3M6T3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C8N3M6T3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1082267,"name":"Herobility HeroSippy, Blue, 140 ml/ 4.7 oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61V0rBclmjL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Herobility super cute Hero Sippy is the perfect cup for a picnic adventure, or for your dinner table. The detachable, cute handles provide an ergonomic grip, ideal for little hands when your baby’s learning to drink all on their own. The adorable feet and tail make it extra steady. The soft spout is gentle on mouths, teeth and gums, and the lid is made to be easy to open and close for little hands. It’s also spill proof, and has a valve function, which only lets out liquids when your child is drinking.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61V0rBclmjL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Herobility","source_asin":"B076BL723G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1082267","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076BL723G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076BL723G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
