window.products.push({"id":1082376,"name":"HALM Glass Straws - 6 Reusable 4 Inch Short Drinking Straws + Plastic-Free Cleaning Brush Perfect for B52 and Shot Glasses or Blowing Tubes & Parapher","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61d5yX96YfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"4 INCH GLASS STRAWs - perfect for B52 or Shot glasses or used as other Accessory or as Blowing Tubes - extremely sturdy and stable straws that are also 100% recyclable. HALM glass straws can handle both cold and heat (from -40 F° to 392 F°) so they are safe for the dishwasher, microwave and even freezer. HALM straws are produced and packaged in Germany where all employees receive fair wages and full benefits. GOOD FOR YOU AND THE PLANET - Most glass straws are made of borosilicate glass, which can never be recycled. That's why we decided to develop a different, 100% recyclable, glass straw to truly reduce our footprint. Our straws, cleaning brush and even packaging are 100% plastic-free and therefore BPA-free, meaning no dangerous toxins in your body. Our production facilities are powered by solar panels. GLASS IS BEST - Remember how refreshing soda tastes out of an old-fashioned glass bottle? Only glass straws are completely taste-neutral, unlike metal, bamboo, silicone, paper, stainless steel or plastic. The rounded glass edges, specially designed for HALM straws, ensure safety and an extra-smooth taste. THE SMALLEST - Our 4 inch straw fits perfectly in 4cl shot glasses and makes your B-52 cocktail more sustainable. Children also love our shortest straw as it fits perfectly in smaller hands and encourages kids to drink more. EASY TO CLEAN - Glass straws, just like your drinking glasses, can be easily cleaned in the dishwasher. Each set also contains a plastic-free cleaning brush for using at the sink or cleaning on the go.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61d5yX96YfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HÅLM","source_asin":"B07QH6CMLM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1082376","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QH6CMLM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QH6CMLM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1082377,"name":"Design Toscano Lord Raffles Grand Hall Lion Leg Side End Table, 26 Inch, walnut","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":855.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816SZeaAS5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Use this versatile work of furniture art near a favorite reading chair, in a welcoming entryway or most anywhere! Our medieval antique replica is a functional side table boasting deeply carved lions heads with bared teeth and majestic lion paws. Coaxed from fine mahogany, it's been hand-rubbed to a burnished finish and distressed just enough to replicate a true antique. Created exclusively for Design Toscano, and named after Lord Thomas Samford Raffles, who founded the British colony of Singapore, this statement piece is an investment in fine European styling. Found only at Toscano! 24\"Wx24\"Dx26\"H. 35 lbs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816SZeaAS5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Design Toscano","source_asin":"B0C1CJ311C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1082377","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1CJ311C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1CJ311C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
