window.products.push({"id":1082402,"name":"2 x Mesh Bath Toy Organizer + 6 Ultra Strong Hooks + Cute (Green) Ladybug Kids Toothbrush Holder – Perfect Toy Storage Net for Baby Bath Toys - This M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xJoaDl4wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NO MORE MOLDY TOYS! Our super strong mesh net makes for the ideal bath toys organizer because the netting is specially spaced so that plenty of air can circulate while all the water drains out. Your kids’ toys will stay dry and clean – not all slimy and wet! POWERFUL SUCTION CUPS + FREE REPLACEMENTS: Unlike some of the other bathroom organizer nets, we include 6 super strong suction cups instead of just 4. Our suction cups 'lock\" once you move the hook down so your bath storage net will stay stuck to the wall without constantly falling off! To ensure the BEST SUCTION possible, please just make sure the surface is FLAT and EVEN. Plus we include 4 DOUBLE SIDED replacement suction pads so you can hang the net ANYWHERE! UNBEATABLE VALUE BUNDLE! Not only do you get the best possible quality mash nets, we also include a super cute ladybug toothbrush. This handy toothbrush holder for kids effortlessly sticks to mirrors, tiles, glass and other smooth surfaces AND it keeps the kids brush safe from dust and bacteria too! MULTI-USE ORGANIZER: This is the bathroom storage and organization solution you’ve been waiting for! The large pocket is perfect for kids’ toys (it holds a ton!) and the second organizer has a pouch and 3 pockets for soap, shampoo and more. Then you can use keep the toothbrushes & toothpaste in the cute holder (electric or normal toothbrushes) – Your child will love it and your bathroom will be kept looking neat and clean, all the time! AND IF YOU DON’T LOVE IT, YOU DON’T PAY! As a small business, we want to make sure all our customers are totally happy with their products. So if you are less than 100% satisfied, for any reason, we offer a FULL money back refund or replacement – anytime, no questioned asked","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xJoaDl4wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Comfylife","source_asin":"B0763LTYCD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1082402","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0763LTYCD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0763LTYCD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
