window.products.push({"id":1082481,"name":"Makeup Organizer - 360-Degree Rotating Cosmetic Storage Case - Large Capacity – 7 Layers DIY Adjustable Versatile Makeup Holder - Fit Toner, Creams, M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713cg1LMs6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Large Storage Capacity and Space-saving: Measured 12.2 Inch (31 CM) in height and 9.45 Inch (24 CM) in base diameter when assembled, the cosmetic storage box can accommodate at least 30 makeup brushes, 20 skincare products (depending on the size of products) with multi compartments to hold combs, lotions, hair spray, perfumes, lipsticks, nail polish, eyeliner, foundations, creams, blushes, eye shadows, jewelry, and more, saving your counter space and keeping your countertop and vanity tidy. 360 Revolving Makeup Organizer: This rotation makeup organizer is a great design for women. The storage carousel rotates smoothly and silently. With its steady 360 rotating base, you can instantly access your cosmetics and get whatever you need in no time by only rotating the organize so as to eliminate your frustration and desperate searching time. 7 Adjustable Layers and Good Load-Bearing Capacity: 7 layers and 4 trays multi-function storage shelf allow you to DIY or adjust the height of the tray to accommodate different types of cosmetics and containers in all shapes and sizes. Made of acrylic high quality material, thick plate and durable trays are strong enough to bear heavy products. Easy to Install and Washable: Quickly assemble and disassemble the makeup storage organizer by following the guide and it is convenient to clean with a dismountable design and washable material. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEED: If you aren't 100% satisfied, just contact us! We promise your money back or replacement with no questions asked or charge.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713cg1LMs6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IBBM","source_asin":"B075Q6PRFP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1082481","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075Q6PRFP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075Q6PRFP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1082482,"name":"Freshware Egg Slicer and Wedger","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.42,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K6d+xMYiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Quickly slice or wedge eggs, mushrooms, kiwis and strawberries with the Freshware KT-421 Egg Slicer and Wedger. Constructed with BPA, PVC and Phthalate FREE material. Our slicer features rust-resistant wire cutters for 11 even slices, or 6 even wedges making it a snap to add eggs, mushrooms or soft fruits to salads and meals. Easy to use, just choose whether you want wedges or slices, then lift up the wire blade handle, place a soft boiled egg, mushroom, peeled kiwi or strawberry in the appropriate holder, then push down the blade handle, that’s it. Your item has been either sliced into 11 pieces or 6 wedges for you. Hand washing recommended for extending the life of the product but it is top rack dishwasher safe. This slicer is an excellent addition to your professional kitchen collection. Size: 8.3 x 3.2 x 1.8 inch.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K6d+xMYiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Freshware","source_asin":"B00OPXKMWY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1082482","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00OPXKMWY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00OPXKMWY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
