window.products.push({"id":1082498,"name":"USA Pan Allergy ID Nonstick Round Cake Pan, 9-Inch, Purple","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hi-+Gql7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With over 15 million Americans and school aged children currently diagnosed with food allergies and sensitivities (wheat being one of the biggest culprits), managing food-related allergies has become more important than ever. When a home has a family member affected by food allergies, careful attention to food preparation is a necessity. USA pan's Purple Allergy ID bakeware provides an easy visual solution to ensure family members don’t use safe bakeware to cook common allergy containing foods. Whether cooking for your family or preparing foods to be shared in a school or community setting everyone can feel comfortable using the allergy ID bakeware. Purple is the standardized Color in commercial settings to identify allergy-free kitchen utensils and equipment and is easy for all family members in the home to recognize as a “safe pan”. USA Pan bakeware is long-lasting, durable, reliable, and comes with a limited lifetime warranty. USA pan's professional grade bakeware helps everyday home bakers produce professional grade baked goods. USA Pan is a Bundy family owned company, based in the greater Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania area that has been producing high performance bakeware for over 50 years. Dimension represent baking surface, not Overall pan size. Proudly made in the USA from globally sourced material.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hi-+Gql7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"USA Pan","source_asin":"B07DXBVHWF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1082498","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DXBVHWF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DXBVHWF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
