window.products.push({"id":1082518,"name":"LANITI Viking Drinking Horn Mug Medieval Style Genuine Ox Horn Mug Artisans Craftsmanship Authentic Tankard for Ale Beer Mug Game Of Thrones Merchandi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FYYJV+lNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Material: Our finest tankard in the house. We ethically select the finest livestock to give you the highest quality horns. Hand-selected for color, appearance, durability, pattern and shape. All our tankards are made with food-safe, high quality resin based material norse gifts for men. Usage: Drinking horn mug can be used for water, wine, ale, beer and when you’re done drinking your viking cup manly cup, slam it down like a Real Vikings. Great gift: Every Viking horn is made of authentic, ethically sourced ox horn , selected for appearance, durability, color pattern and shape. Each horn crafted by our artisans has been fashioning drinking horns for generations. The inspired tankard is unique in shape & color & comes ready to use and show off to you friends. Handcrafted with care:Feel like a chief with our Viking Horn drinking Mug. Each horn is unique and comes ready for display or use. Have the horn engraved with a name, wedding dedication, or favorite quote! Great gift idea for beer mugs for dads! Our Promise: Laniti was established in 1999, We focus on offering high qualified products to our customers as well as bringing the latest trends to your daily life.100% money back if you are not satisfied with our Laniti Genuine Ox beer mug game of thrones merchandise.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FYYJV+lNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LANITI","source_asin":"B09414JQMT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1082518","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09414JQMT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09414JQMT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1082519,"name":"Knitted Weighted Blanket(48\"x72\" 12lbs)Cooling Chunky Knit Heavy Blanket for Adults Braided Crochet Throw Blanket Thick Cable Yarn Knit Decorative Bla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71faZs+kQTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【MORE BREATHABLE】: The knitted weighted blanket has the same weight as normal weighted blanket. At the same time, knitted weighted blankets have a series of advantages that normal weighted blankets do not have. Firstly, knitted weighted blankets are more breathable, because there are many small knitted holes on the surface of blankets, and the air can directly circulate through the small holes, while normal weighted blankets are filled with polyester fibers and have poor breathability. 【NEVER LEAK BEADS】: When using normal weighted blankets, we always worry that the bed will be covered by glass beads after waking up in the morning. Now that we have knitted weighted blanket, we no longer have to worry about this problem. Because there are no glass beads in the knitted weighted blanket.The knitted weighted blanket is made of very thick polyester yarn and is not filled with glass beads, so there will never be a problem of glass beads leaking. 【THE WEIGHT DISTRIBUTION IS MORE EVEN】: the weight of the normal weighted blanket comes from glass beads, and the weight of the whole blanket is uneven due to the uneven distribution of the glass beads. The weight of the knitted weighted blanket comes from each rope, and the thickness of each rope is the same, so the weight distribution of the entire blanket is also uniform. 【BETTER DECORATION EFFECT】: normal weighted blankets are simple in shape and cannot be used as decorations, but knitted weighted blankets can be used as decorations to decorate our rooms. Knitted weighted blanket has luxurious appearance and unique design.We can spread it on the bed, sofa, chair to make our living environment unique. 【MACHINE WASHABLE】: The knitted weighted blanket can be machine washed. And compared to normal weighted blankets of the same size and weight, knitted weighted blankets are smaller and more convenient to store. When you don’t want to use this knitted weighted blanket, you can easily put it in a cabinet or a box, which is very convenient. And it doesn't take up space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71faZs+kQTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"L'AGRATY","source_asin":"B09LYWB1JK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1082519","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LYWB1JK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LYWB1JK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
