window.products.push({"id":1082672,"name":"LolliZ® Candle #1 First Birthday. Pack of 1. Pink w/White Polka Dots. Unique Novelty Design","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/412ec4kAwOL._AC_.jpg","description":"Feeling discouraged in your search for the cutest and most cheerful 1st birthday candle? Do not give up; LolliZ Birthday Candles are here to save the day. With a nice, eclectic variety to choose from, find the perfect match to the awesome party you are throwing! Fun, Expressive Novelty Candles, Perfect Presentation Light up the party and make it count! LolliZ candles are sure to get your child, in fact all guest kids, extra excited about candle blowing out time. The fun, expressive polka dots coupled with the unique novelty designs are sure to brighten up the room and your wee toddler's face. Create a complementing visual with the rest of your party décor. Parents, rest easy, no worries about the candle bending out of shape or falling out, LolliZ candles will stick out straight and stand tall on most cakes. Tested on a wide variety of ingredients, the candles stand nice and tall. Long lasting Burn, Minimal Drip, No Mess Thanks to a remarkable wax mixture and a great attention to detail during all phases of creation, LolliZ candles boast unrivaled qualities!  Impress guests as well as the birthday child with a cake that stays put, presentable (and most of all edible!) !  The candles last long enough for you to snap the perfect shot and delightfully appreciate every single one of the kid's blowing out attempts! Hey kids! Don't forget to make a wish! SAFETY WARNING: ATTENTION:  * Do not leave a candle to burn without supervision.  * Do not light up LolliZ candles near any object prone to catching fire.  * Keep out of children's reach. Not suitable for children under 3 years old.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/412ec4kAwOL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LolliZ","source_asin":"B00YBFAEO2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1082672","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00YBFAEO2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00YBFAEO2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1082673,"name":"10 inch 20 Pcs Natural Rattan Wood Reed Diffuser Sticks Essential Oil Aroma Replacement Aroma Reed Diffuser Sticks (Brown-20pcs)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DPk1Qc3ZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Reed diffusers are a wonderful way to fragrance your home with the essential oil of your choice. Unlike the more traditional rattan diffusers which are plant based and often unethically sourced in Asia, our revolutionary fiber reed diffusers use Eco-friendly, non organic and toxin-free materials. 100% safe because you don’t use a flame to diffuse the oils and not get faded as rattan diffusers 10 inches long, but can be easily cut to the size you want without splitting Uniform in size and shape, so look neater as a home decoration piece Simply place the reed sticks in the solution and let it saturates the reeds. Take the reeds out, and place the opposite ends into the bottle to quickly start the process. To intensify fragrance, turn sticks upside down once a week. For the best result, replace sticks once a month.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DPk1Qc3ZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"nongcunren","source_asin":"B09L7PQYBR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1082673","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09L7PQYBR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09L7PQYBR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
