window.products.push({"id":1082679,"name":"BestPysanky Fancy Agate Polished Stone Egg","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CffkYaYbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Representing elements of Earth's geological past, these rich brown and golden patterns show how detailed and perfect Mother Nature could be. The texture and colors of this egg can make them the perfect decorations for a centerpiece or on top of the fireplace. These stone eggs are obtained by exploding the mountains for stones, which are cut into smaller pieces to be crafted. Each stone is taken and sculptured by hand to be transformed into a unique and stylish egg. Rubbing and polishing them at the end adds the perfect finishing touch to bring shininess and smoothness. 2.25 Inches Tall x 1.75 Inches in Diameter Agate Stone Colors and Patterns may Slightly Differ (One of a kind item) Wooden Stand Stone eggs are commonly polished in a rock tumbler. You may also polish them on diamond grinding wheels by hand, using sandpaper or cut them with a saw and polish them on a flat lap. The basic procedure is to tumble the rocks with progressively finer grits and polishes until the desired egg shape and shine is achieved. It may take 4 to 6 weeks to finish a batch. Designed and dyed by nature herself, these polished natural stone eggs are the pictured definition of elegance itself. Much more understated than the usual brightly colored Easter egg, natural Rock Eggs convey just the right combination of gravitas and playfulness. Due to unique patterns in the stone, each of these eggs is one of a kind. Keep your memories of Easter alive forever with gemstone Easter eggs that will never spoil or fade with age. A perfect gift this holiday season for your most beloved.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CffkYaYbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BestPysanky","source_asin":"B00GP9HFDU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1082679","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GP9HFDU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GP9HFDU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
