window.products.push({"id":1082696,"name":"Pampas Grass Decor Tall by PAMPAS PLACE - Dried Natural Tall Flowers 48\"(4ft) Large Fluffy Stems 5 pcs for Home Decor, Boho Decor & Rustic Decor. Flor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WYXapRv3S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ABOUT PAMPAS GRASS: Pampas grass are real plants that originate from the pampas region in South America. These natural flower arrangements are harvested and then naturally dried before being carefully selected and sent to you. You don't have to worry about caring for them or watering them during your vacation. These versatile and stylish flowers are low maintenance and will last you for years, creating an amazing impression and bring life to your space. OUR QUALITY SELECTION: We are a family business dedicated to provide you with the best quality pampas out there. While some other competitors will sell you stems, we sell you plumes. The stems are the bare part while the plumes are the fluffy part. We only selected the longest and fluffiest plumes in the market. If you receive a damaged piece, please simply contact us and we will replace it for free. We guarantee your satisfaction and peace of mind. PRODUCT SPECIFICATIONS: Our high quality pompas grass come on a generous 48\" (120cm) length, with a 28 to 32\" (70 to 80cm) of plume size ensuring you have the most beautiful and fluffy boho flowers out there. These are some of the largest plumes in the market, and we guarantee you will see the difference. COLOR: We know your pampas color is important to you. Pampas grass is a natural plant. It has different tones, shades and no two are alike. However, what sets us apart from our competitors is the fact that we spend time to select close match color pampas in the same batch to create the most cohesive look for your place. All our photos were taken with our products in natural day light, so what you see is what you get. PACKAGING: We have created a special packaging to help such a delicate piece get to you in its best shape: Sturdy, yet minimalist, making it the perfect gift. Our packaging is eco-friendly, dye-free and designed with minimum plastic (because we care about our planet). We are aiming on having all our packaging made from recycled materials. Packaging includes 5 pampas and a user manual with a QR code for instructions and tips video that will help you achieve the final look we have in the photos. DISCLAIMER: Please follow the instructions provided to achieve the final results similar to the photos provided. Pampas will shed initially (this is normal) and will stop after deshedding and blow-drying. This will not affect the quality of the pampas. Loose stems have to be peeled off. Then, style and spray them with hair spray and voilà! Vases not included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WYXapRv3S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pampas Place","source_asin":"B08RW7Y8N3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1082696","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RW7Y8N3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RW7Y8N3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
